---
// Booking steps and why-us section with clean vector icons (no emojis)
---
<section class="sec sec-white" id="booking" aria-labelledby="book-h">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div>
      <span class="sec-badge">SEAMLESS PLANNING</span>
      <h2 id="book-h">How Booking Works</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2rem">No complex checkout forms or hidden platform charges. Plan and confirm in 3 simple steps.</p>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <b>Pick Your Dates & Travellers</b>
            <span>Choose any package or tell us your preferred dates on WhatsApp. No account creation needed.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <b>Get Custom Itinerary within 24 Hours</b>
            <span>Receive an all-inclusive quote with permits, transfers, stays, and transparent day plans.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <b>Lock In with Small Advance</b>
            <span>Pay via UPI or direct bank transfer. The remaining balance is payable just 7 days before departure.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div>
      <span class="sec-badge">WHY CHOOSE US</span>
      <h2>The Mountain Advantage</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2rem">Every package is planned and operated by locals who live and drive in the Himalayas.</p>

      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg class="i b-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-home"></use></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>100% Verified Homestays</h4>
            <p>Personally inspected family homestays and mountain boutique resorts with scenic peak views.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg class="i b-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-car"></use></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Expert Mountain Drivers</h4>
            <p>Reliable local drivers experienced on tricky Himalayan roads. Clean private cabs for all transfers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg class="i b-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"></use></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Dedicated WhatsApp Support</h4>
            <p>A real travel companion on WhatsApp from the day you book until you reach back home.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg class="i b-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-refresh"></use></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Flexible Date Changes</h4>
            <p>Weather or schedule change? Reschedule your trip dates for free up to 7 days before travel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sec-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary);
    background: var(--primary-light);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .steps li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    background: var(--bg-card-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--r-m);
    transition: transform 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .steps li:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 140, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .step-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .step-body b {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .step-body span {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 500px) {
    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .benefit-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.3rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--r-m);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .benefit-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: var(--r-s);
    background: var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .b-svg {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .benefit-card h4 {
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
